<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Core Benefits</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">CORE BENEFITS are provided by <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> at no cost to the employee. The following Core Benefits take effect the day that an employee meets the eligibility requirements.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 25px;">Core Life Insurance/ Core Accidental Death and Dismemberment (AD&D) Insurance</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Provider: <span data-field="provider_name">{{ provider_name }}</span></li>
    <li>Benefit Amount: <span data-field="benefit_amount_description">{{ benefit_amount_description }}</span>, Minimum of <span data-field="min_life_insurance">{{ min_life_insurance }}</span> Life Insurance Maximum of <span data-field="max_life_insurance">{{ max_life_insurance }}</span>, <span data-field="addd_benefit_description">{{ addd_benefit_description }}</span> and <span data-field="addd_benefit_amount">{{ addd_benefit_amount }}</span> AD&D Insurance Benefit</li>
    <li>Eligibility: The first of the month coinciding with or next following hire date.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 25px;">Short Term Disability Insurance</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Provides <span data-field="std_disability_benefit_percentage">{{ std_disability_benefit_percentage }}</span> Of Weekly Base Pay</li>
    <li>Benefit Duration of Up To Six (6) Months</li>
    <li>A Waiting Period Applies</li>
    <li>A 90-day service requirement applies before you are eligible for this benefit.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 25px;">Long Term Disability Insurance</h3>
