    <p>Vitals SmartShopper is a new program offered by <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span> that lets you shop for lower-cost health care and choose from several possibilities. Vitals SmartShopper is for all employees and their dependents enrolled in the <span data-field="plan.name">{{ plan.name }}</span> and the <span data-field="plan.name">{{ plan.name }}</span>.</p>
    <ul>
