        <li>Save money and make the most efficient use of your health care benefits</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="section-title">TUITION REMISSION</div>
    <p><strong>Wilkes University:</strong> Undergraduate and graduate credits to all full-time employees, spouses, same-gender domestic partners, and dependent sons and daughters after the employee has completed <span data-field="duration.number">{{ duration.number }}</span> ninety calendar days of service. The tuition benefit covers <span data-field="coverage.percentage">{{ coverage.percentage }}</span> of the actual tuition cost. The employee is responsible for applicable fees and textbook costs.</p>
    <p><strong>Other Tuition Programs:</strong> <span data-field="institution.name">{{ institution.name }}</span>, <span data-field="institution.name">{{ institution.name }}</span>, and <span data-field="institution.name">{{ institution.name }}</span>.</p>
    <p>Please refer to the <span data-field="policy.name">{{ policy.name }}</span> for a complete description of the tuition benefits and eligibility requirements.</p>

    <div class="section-title">RETIREMENT SAVINGS PLAN</div>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Provider:</strong> <span data-field="provider.name">{{ provider.name }}</span></li>
        <li><strong>Plan Type:</strong> <span data-field="plan.type">{{ plan.type }}</span></li>
        <li><strong>Contributions:</strong> Effective <span data-field="date.start">{{ date.start }}</span> the University contributes <span data-field="contribution.percentage">{{ contribution.percentage }}</span> of your base pay, provided you contribute a minimum of <span data-field="contribution.percentage">{{ contribution.percentage }}</span> (subject to change). Effective <span data-field="date.effective">{{ date.effective }}</span>, the University has suspended its contribution into your retirement account (subject to change). For more information, please contact <span data-field="contact.name">{{ contact.name }}</span>, Senior Employee Benefits Administrator at <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span> or <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span>.</li>
        <li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Employees hired on or after <span data-field="date.hire_start">{{ date.hire_start }}</span>, one (1) year of Eligibility of Service shall be required (subject to change). Employees hired before <span data-field="date.hire_end">{{ date.hire_end }}</span> the first of the month coinciding with or next following <span data-field="duration.number">{{ duration.number }}</span> days of hire (subject to change).</li>
        <li><strong>University Matching Contributions Vesting:</strong> Employees hired on or after <span data-field="date.vesting_start">{{ date.vesting_start }}</span>, shall be vested according to the following schedule: <span data-field="vesting_schedule_1">{{ vesting_schedule_1 }}</span> vesting for less than one (1) year of service, <span data-field="vesting_schedule_2">{{ vesting_schedule_2 }}</span> vesting for at least one (1) year of service, <span data-field="vesting_schedule_3">{{ vesting_schedule_3 }}</span> vesting for at least two (2) years of service, <span data-field="vesting_schedule_4">{{ vesting_schedule_4 }}</span> vesting for at least three (3) years of service, <span data-field="vesting_schedule_5">{{ vesting_schedule_5 }}</span> vesting for at least four (4) years of service, and <span data-field="vesting_schedule_6">{{ vesting_schedule_6 }}</span> vesting for five (5) or more years of service (subject to change). Employees hired prior to <span data-field="date.vesting_prior">{{ date.vesting_prior }}</span> shall be 100% and immediately vested.</li>
